AetherEngine display and software startup backports

https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/a4b7fa8cf76c4883c2a5d7a47516d2e1676cc754
https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/d964375a659c8a1769d9b5284afb39e3ed44a459

The vendor pin includes the first #950 fix, which distinguishes an in-flight
switch's end from the next switch. Keep it and remove the post-end delay.

